msgstr "Voer hier specifieke details in..."

#. module: mrp_workcenter_safety_symbol_specification
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mrp_workcenter_safety_symbol_specification.view_mrp_workcenter_safety_specification_list
